Association StudentLanguageInstructionProgramAssociation based on GeneralStudentProgramAssociation
    documentation "This association represents the Title III Language Instruction for Limited English Proficient and Immigrant Students program(s) that a student participates in or from which the Student receives services."
    common EnglishLanguageProficiencyAssessment
        documentation "Results of yearly English language assessment."
        is optional collection
    bool EnglishLearnerParticipation
        documentation "An indication that an English Learner student is served by an English language instruction educational program supported with Title III of ESEA funds."
        is optional
    common LanguageInstructionProgramService
        documentation "Indicates the service(s) being provided to the Student by the Language Instruction Program."
        is optional collection
